Z||000022||isthiswhereiputausername?||05-23-2001||09:24 PM||||I know the feeling Lisa..   We had our fiero broke into one night at the movie theater.<P>We were in a hurry (late  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> )and didn't remove the faceplate off the cd player and they ripped the dash when they pulled the cd player out and also had the passengers side window smashed out ,trunk pried open and our evenings shopping stolen..(even though there was a remote trunk switch????) along with the drivers seat track bent when it was jammed ahead(looking for a sub I guess) also lost about 40 cds (30 originals -rest cdrs  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> )<BR>insurance covered part of it..but still a nasty feeling and ruins your evening  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P><BR>||||reg||9
